[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5330791113","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122549#issuecomment-5330791113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122549","id":5330791113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPb1qyQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T16:01:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T16:01:05Z","body":"I can't reproduce it, are you using modified Xcode project, or other libs / GDExtensions that are directly using SDL? While there symbols are indeed missing, ` SDL_IsTablet` and `SDL_IsTV` calling them are not used by the engine and should be optimized out.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5330791113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331069475","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122549#issuecomment-5331069475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122549","id":5331069475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPcGqIw","user":{"login":"LitteRabbit-37","id":133410979,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_Owow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133410979?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37","html_url":"https://github.com/LitteRabbit-37","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LitteRabbit-37/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T16:23:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T16:23:54Z","body":"No modified Xcode project, it's generated by the exporter with \"Export Project Only\" and built as-is. No GDExtensions, no native libraries in the project, and the three addons are pure GDScript. The only libraries linked are the ones the template ships.\n\nI think the difference is the linker version. Build settings on my side:\n```\nXCODE_VERSION_ACTUAL = 2630 (Xcode 26.3)\nDEAD_CODE_STRIPPING = YES\nOTHER_LDFLAGS = (empty)\n```\n\n`OTHER_LDFLAGS` is `$(LD_CLASSIC_$(XCODE_VERSION_ACTUAL))`, and the generated project only defines `LD_CLASSIC_1500/1501/1510`, so on Xcode 26 it resolves to nothing and the modern linker is used. Dead stripping is on, yet the reference from `SDL_IsTablet/SDL_IsTV` still has to resolve at link time.\n\nSo it may only reproduce on Xcode 26.x.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331069475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331137288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122549#issuecomment-5331137288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122549","id":5331137288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPcKzCA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-18T16:29:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T16:29:33Z","body":"> So it may only reproduce on Xcode 26.x.\n\nI have tested it with Xcode 26.6 and 27.0 beta, and was not able to reproduce it on either.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5331137288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_githu